<title>GERMANY: Siemens sees 1996/97 sales up four pct.</title>
<headline>Siemens sees 1996/97 sales up four pct.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Siemens AG expects 1996/97 sales to rise about four percent, while incoming orders would increase at a somewhat slower pace, finance director Karl-Hermann Baumann told the annual news conference.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
